{
  "slug": "oh-my-toomuchtalker",
  "name": "Oh My Toomuchtalker",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A global shoutboard for Claude Code. Post short messages and see random shouts from other developers on\nyour statusline. Comes with a leaderboard, mute system, and seamless HUD integration that chains with any\nexisting statusline setup.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 MCP server**, `toomuchtalker`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install oh-my-toomuchtalker@claude-community` from `tristanjung1006/oh-my-toomuchtalker`.\n\nA global shoutboard for Claude Code. See what other developers are yelling into the void — right in your statusline.",
